---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Builder, Linux Enthusiast, Lifelong Learner."
	pubDate={new Date('2025-01-01')}
>
	<section class="intro-card">
		<p class="eyebrow">Welcome to my little corner of the web!</p>
		<h2>Hey, I'm Razo Beckett</h2>
		<p>
			I'm a curious builder who enjoys creating software, exploring Linux, and learning how
			things work under the hood. I spend most of my time working on personal projects,
			experimenting with new tools, and sharing thoughts on technology, development,
			productivity, and the lessons I pick up along the way.
		</p>
		<p>
			This blog serves as my digital notebook, a place to document projects, ideas,
			discoveries, and occasional opinions on the tools and technologies I use.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h3>What I Do</h3>
		<p>
			I build software, create command-line tools, explore AI-assisted development, and
			experiment with new technologies. I'm particularly interested in Linux, open source
			software, automation, privacy, self-hosting, and developer tools. When I'm not
			building something, I'm usually learning, tinkering, or writing about what I've
			discovered.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h3>Let's Connect</h3>
		<p>
			If something here sparks an idea, feel free to reach out, share a thought, or just
			say hi.
		</p>
		<p>
			<a href="https://link.razobeckett.xyz/gh?utm_source=blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> ·
			<a href="https://link.razobeckett.xyz/lnkd?utm_source=blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a> ·
			<a href="https://link.razobeckett.xyz/x?utm_source=blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Twitter</a> ·
			<a href="https://link.razobeckett.xyz/pfo?utm_source=blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Portfolio</a>
		</p>
	</section>

	<p>Thanks for stopping by. I'm glad you're here.</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.intro-card {
		padding: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.intro-card {
			padding: 1.25rem;
		}
	}
</style>
